## Essential Pre-Work Checklist

Before starting any task:
- [ ] Read relevant rule files listed above
- [ ] If working with ROS2 package: Read package README.md
- [ ] If exploring codebase: Read CLAUDE.md
- [ ] Verify naming conventions from coding_standards.md

## Global Context
- **CLAUDE.md**: Project-wide architecture and guidelines at project root
- **.claude/**: Contains all templates, rules, skills, and scripts